cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DarkRoute"
abstract: >-
  An offline-capable, account-free progressive web app that warns drivers about
  automatic licence plate readers. Camera locations come from OpenStreetMap
  under ODbL; plate values stay in the encrypted on-device vault and are never
  sent to or queried against a remote service.
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-01"
url: "https://github.com/darkcodelabs/darkroute"
repository-code: "https://github.com/darkcodelabs/darkroute"
authors:
